  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4ccb9ec26123af48a2a1fbc049847f7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GameModeDescriptions
  standard: Battle across the lands and reach the final boss. Different buffs & debuffs
    will be offered after each level. Level modifiers last for only one level.
  chaos: Choose a level modifier every other level. All level modifiers stay active
    and stack for the rest of the run. Earn 20% additional experience in this game
    mode!
  marathon: Battle endlessly. Deal damage to level up, gain reinforcements, and choose
    between different combinations of paired buffs & debuffs. The difficulty will
    keep rising over time, survive as long as you can!
